# Addon startup — Main.lua

Every addon under `Addons/<Name>/` **must** include a `src/Main.lua` startup script. See rule `addon-src-folder`.

## Responsibilities

`Main.lua` only handles startup:

1. `local VERSION = "x.y.z"` constant (keep in sync with TOC `## Version`)
2. `Addon.VERSION = VERSION` on the shared addon table
3. `WoWF.PrintLoadBanner(ADDON_NAME, VERSION)` — no banner calls in feature scripts

```lua
local ADDON_NAME, Addon = ...

local VERSION = "0.1.0"

Addon.VERSION = VERSION

WoWF.PrintLoadBanner(ADDON_NAME, VERSION)
```

## TOC load order

`Common\...` → `src\Main.lua` → feature scripts in `src\`. Never put feature logic in `Main.lua`.

```toc
## Interface: 16001
## Title: JunkMaster
## Version: 0.1.0

Common\DevMode.lua
Common\Logger.lua
src\Main.lua
src\JunkMaster.lua
```

## Feature scripts

- Use `local ADDON_NAME, Addon = ...`
- Read `Addon.VERSION` when needed; do not redefine VERSION
- Do not call `PrintLoadBanner` outside `Main.lua`
